request.description:
## Webhook Reference (Not an actual request to send)

This is an example of the payload PayLink sends to your configured webhook URL when a subscribed event occurs.

**Available Event Types:**
- `invoice.paid` - Invoice was successfully paid (enabled by default)
- `invoice.not_paid` - Payment attempt failed (enabled by default)
- `invoice.voided` - Payment was voided within 24h
- `invoice.refunded` - Payment was refunded (full or partial)
- `invoice.authorization_reversed` - Authorized payment was reversed
- `subscription.activated` - Subscription mandate activated after first payment
- `subscription.charged` - A recurring cycle charge succeeded
- `subscription.payment_failed` - A cycle charge attempt failed
- `subscription.suspended` - Mandate suspended after repeated failures
- `subscription.cancelled` - Mandate was cancelled
- `subscription.completed` - All billing cycles completed

Configure which events trigger webhooks under **Settings > Payment Integrations > Webhook Events**.

**Your webhook endpoint should:**
1. Verify the HMAC signature
2. Check the `event` field to determine the event type
3. Process the status update accordingly
4. Return HTTP 200 OK

**Webhook Payload Fields:**
- `event` (string) - Event type that triggered the webhook (excluded from signature)
- `event_triggered_at` (string) - ISO 8601 timestamp of when the event fired (excluded from signature)
- `timezone` (string) - Timezone code for the timestamp, e.g. UTC (excluded from signature)
- `success` (integer) - 1 for successful operations, 0 for failed
- `invoice_id` (integer) - Unique invoice identifier
- `invoice_status` (string) - PAID, UNPAID, VOIDED, REFUNDED, PARTIALLY_REFUNDED, or REVERSED
- `message` (string) - Human-readable status message
- `signature` (string) - HMAC-SHA256 signature for verification

**Signature Verification:**
Concatenate: success + invoice_id + invoice_status + message (exclude `event`)
Then verify using HMAC-SHA256 with your hash token.

**Retry Policy:**
If your endpoint doesn't return 200, PayLink retries up to 3 times with 100ms intervals.

**PHP Verification Example:**
```php
$data = $request->all();
// Note: 'event' is excluded from signature calculation
$concatenated = $data['success'] . $data['invoice_id'] . $data['invoice_status'] . $data['message'];
$expectedSignature = base64_encode(hash_hmac('sha256', $concatenated, $hashToken, true));

if (!hash_equals($expectedSignature, $data['signature'])) {
    return response()->json(['error' => 'Invalid signature'], 403);
}

// Route by event type
switch ($data['event']) {
    case 'invoice.paid':
        // Handle successful payment
        break;
    case 'invoice.not_paid':
        // Handle failed payment
        break;
    case 'invoice.voided':
        // Handle voided payment
        break;
    case 'invoice.refunded':
        // Handle refund
        break;
    case 'invoice.authorization_reversed':
        // Handle authorization reversal
        break;
}

return response()->json(['success' => true, 'message' => 'Webhook processed successfully']);
```
